<div class="header">
  <div class="headertitle"><div class="title">OfflineState Class Reference</div></div>
</div><!--header-->
<div class="contents">

<p>Connection state corresponding to when the NetworkManager is shut down. From this state we can transition to the ClientConnecting sate, if starting as a client, or the StartingServer state, if starting as a server.  
 <a href="#details">More...</a></p>
