<a name="details" id="details"></a><h2 id="header-details" class="groupheader">Detailed Description</h2>
<div class="textblock"><p>Connection state corresponding to when the NetworkManager is shut down. From this state we can transition to the ClientConnecting sate, if starting as a client, or the StartingServer state, if starting as a server. </p>
